(text "PM3 / PM4 / PM5 are repurposed LED ports: MIL, heater enable and optional EGR.\nThese assignments require firmware output-resource review before use. USB and SD remain on the genuine card.\nLegacy batch injector and stepper ports are exposed on the service header; no duplicate legacy injector stages fitted.\nDo not substitute an MS1/MS2 pinout. The module is powered through its documented 5 V and 12 V interfaces." (at 15 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fe0c1162-2f3e-5b9b-a39b-12e245c9ddb0))
